+---
+id: task-003-restore-welcome-coupon-after-cancellation-and-fix-50-shipping
+type: task
+title: "Restore welcome coupon after cancellation and fix €50 shipping"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Request
+
+Address two order-service reports:
+
+1. A customer cancelled an order on the day it was placed, but the single-use welcome coupon remained unavailable for the corrected order.
+2. Delivery was charged €4.90 when goods totalled exactly €50.00, despite the free-delivery threshold.
+
+## Acceptance
+
+- Cancelling an eligible order releases its single-use coupon for reuse, including when the coupon code differs only in letter case.
+- Goods totalling exactly €50.00 after discounts and before VAT receive free shipping.
+- Add regression coverage for both reports and update affected documentation if behavior was inconsistent.
